  shots:
  - lines:
    - speaker: 1
      text: Switch one is back online! Hear that hum? That is the good kind of hum.
      condition: 0
  - lines:
    - speaker: 0
      text: Painting line breached. Guard Bot, hold the room.
      condition: 0
    - speaker: 1
      text: Next stop, the Painting Room. The colour line is badly out of calibration.
      condition: 0
  - lines:
    - speaker: 1
      text: Shoot all four spinning targets before the timer runs out, then hack that terminal.
      condition: 0
    - speaker: 1
      text: Heads up. That terminal beeps like crazy, and the Guard Bot loves hiding behind cover.
      condition: 0
